<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-ENGLISH AND SCOTTISH FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ENGLISH AND SCOTTISH FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
